---
import MainLayout from "../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
---

<MainLayout title="Experience | Nick Ruffin">
  <div class="projects-container">
    <div class="bg-grid"></div>
    <div class="projects-inner">
      <div class="projects-header">
        <span class="projects-tag reveal">EXPERIENCE</span>
        <h1 class="reveal reveal-delay-1">Twelve years of engineering. Pharmacy, data, and enterprise systems.</h1>
        <p class="reveal reveal-delay-2">Currently leading engineering for RedSail Technologies' pharmacy-data monetization platform. Previously Director, Full Stack Development at Nimble Solutions through four healthcare acquisitions.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="one-card-wrapper reveal">
        <div class="major-project-card">
          <div class="role-header">
            <div>
              <h2>Manager, Data Engineering</h2>
              <p class="role-company">RedSail Technologies</p>
            </div>
            <span class="role-dates">Feb 2025 &ndash; Present</span>
          </div>
          <p class="project-intro">Manage commercial data delivery for RedSail's pharmacy-data monetization platform, with ownership of nearly 40 live production feeds to 30+ pharma manufacturer, RWE, and alt-data organizations. Primary technical partner for customer relationships and business development.</p>

          <div class="stage-block">
            <div class="stage-title"><span>The Commercial Motion</span><hr /></div>
            <strong>18 manufacturer copay assistance and voucher discount programs</strong>
            <p>The feeds pharma manufacturers run their patient-affordability programs on, plus clinical program and pharmacy-services partner feeds. DUA-governed and operational rather than analytical &mdash; sold and held to latency, coverage, and reliability commitments, where a missed delivery is a commercial problem, not a backlog item.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="stage-block">
            <div class="stage-title"><span>The Platform</span><hr /></div>
            <strong>Multiple delivery motions, one 7-figure ARR platform</strong>
            <p><strong>De-identified, patient-level tokenized claims feeds</strong> for RWE aggregators, running on AWS Fargate + ECS + Snowflake. <strong>Identified PHI into customer-controlled AWS or Azure environments</strong> for buyers running their own tokenization engines. <strong>Cross-source combined feeds</strong> joining multiple pharmacy systems &mdash; the newest motion, unlocking expansion at existing accounts. Growth comes from expansion, not new logos.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="stage-block">
            <div class="stage-title"><span>The Estate</span><hr /></div>
            <strong>Multi-cloud delivery and platform consolidation</strong>
            <p>Delivery runs across AWS and Azure and multiple Snowflake accounts. I am migrating customer feeds onto a shared combined-feed pipeline to cut per-customer tokenization and processing cost, retiring redundant legacy pipelines while holding delivery continuity for every account on the platform.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="stage-block">
            <div class="stage-title"><span>The Differentiation</span><hr /></div>
            <strong>NCPDP-standard pharmacy-data fluency</strong>
            <p>Pharmacy transaction data is not claims data, and customer engineering teams usually find that out mid-integration. I set the technical standard for how customers consume it &mdash; join-key design, cross-source reconciliation, and file-format decisions across every customer integration &mdash; and provide the same framing on business development calls and contract reviews so commercial commitments match delivery reality.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="stage-block">
            <div class="stage-title"><span>The Governance</span><hr /></div>
            <strong>Regulatory readiness across the platform</strong>
            <p>HIPAA compliance, Expert Determination coordination with third-party evaluators, proof-of-delivery audit trails, and provenance documentation for customer legal reviews. Building the engineering function to remove single-person dependencies from customer delivery.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="stack-banner reveal">
        <span class="stack-label">CURRENT STACK</span>
        <div class="stack-items">
          <span class="stack-item">Snowflake</span><span class="stack-dot"></span>
          <span class="stack-item">AWS (Fargate, ECS, MWAA, S3, Lambda)</span><span class="stack-dot"></span>
          
          <span class="stack-item">Tokenization</span><span class="stack-dot"></span>
          <span class="stack-item">Airflow</span><span class="stack-dot"></span>
          <span class="stack-item">Terraform</span><span class="stack-dot"></span>
          <span class="stack-item">GitHub Actions</span><span class="stack-dot"></span>
          <span class="stack-item">Python</span><span class="stack-dot"></span>
          <span class="stack-item">SQL</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="prior-section reveal">
        <span class="prior-tag">PRIOR EXPERIENCE</span>

        <div class="prior-card">
          <div class="role-header">
            <div>
              <h3>Director, Full Stack Development</h3>
              <p class="role-company">Nimble Solutions</p>
            </div>
            <span class="role-dates">Aug 2021 &ndash; Feb 2025</span>
          </div>
          <p>Reported to the CIO. Built out and managed the software and RPA engineering teams across US and offshore, plus a project manager, and later took on the data team, through the company's inorganic growth phase.</p>
          <ul class="prior-list">
            <li>Technical partner to the CIO on four healthcare acquisitions &mdash; supported technical due diligence, TCO analysis, integration sequencing, and stack rationalization. Traveled to Hyderabad to fold the acquired team into US operations.</li>
            <li>Designed and shipped a microservices .NET AR reimbursement work queue on an n-tiered architecture with full monitoring and observability &mdash; revenue-ordered, backed by historical AR aging &mdash; that lifted rep throughput to 30+ claims/day per rep.</li>
            <li>Integrated 20+ practice management systems into a unified data warehouse via RPA-based extraction, Azure function apps, and custom API integrations through Availity and Waystar &mdash; patterns that made post-acquisition system consolidation economically feasible instead of a rebuild-per-acquisition drag on margin.</li>
            <li>Partnered with CIO, VP of Infrastructure, and CISO on technical strategy, vendor evaluations, and annual capex/opex planning; established CI/CD (60% deployment-time reduction) and 90%+ test coverage across US and offshore teams.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="prior-card">
          <div class="role-header">
            <div>
              <h3>Senior Full Stack Developer</h3>
              <p class="role-company">Core &amp; Main</p>
            </div>
            <span class="role-dates">Jun 2017 &ndash; Aug 2021</span>
          </div>
          <p>Built enterprise data applications in C#/.NET and SQL supporting 200+ concurrent corporate users across operations.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="case-cta reveal">
        <a href="/nicholas-ruffin-resume.pdf" target="_blank" class="cta-button">Download Resume</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script>
    function initCircuit() {
      const canvas = document.getElementById('circuit-canvas') as HTMLCanvasElement;
      if (!canvas) return;
      const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');
      if (!ctx) return;
      let w = canvas.width = window.innerWidth;
      let h = canvas.height = canvas.parentElement!.scrollHeight;
      let animId: number;
      let time = 0;

      interface Node { x: number; y: number; pulsePhase: number; connections: number[]; }
      const nodes: Node[] = [];
      const gridSize = 80;
      const cols = Math.ceil(w / gridSize);
      const rows = Math.ceil(h / gridSize);

      for (let r = 0; r < rows; r++) {
        for (let c = 0; c < cols; c++) {
          if (Math.random() > 0.3) continue;
          const node: Node = {
            x: c * gridSize + (Math.random() * 30 - 15),
            y: r * gridSize + (Math.random() * 30 - 15),
            pulsePhase: Math.random() * Math.PI * 2,
            connections: [],
          };
          nodes.push(node);
        }
      }
      // Connect nearby nodes
      for (let i = 0; i < nodes.length; i++) {
        for (let j = i + 1; j < nodes.length; j++) {
          const dx = nodes[i].x - nodes[j].x;
          const dy = nodes[i].y - nodes[j].y;
          if (Math.sqrt(dx*dx + dy*dy) < gridSize * 1.8 && nodes[i].connections.length < 3) {
            nodes[i].connections.push(j);
          }
        }
      }

      function draw() {
        ctx!.clearRect(0, 0, w, h);
        time += 0.01;

        // Draw connections with traveling pulse
        for (const node of nodes) {
          for (const ci of node.connections) {
            const target = nodes[ci];
            ctx!.beginPath();
            ctx!.moveTo(node.x, node.y);
            // Right-angle paths (circuit style)
            const midX = (node.x + target.x) / 2;
            ctx!.lineTo(midX, node.y);
            ctx!.lineTo(midX, target.y);
            ctx!.lineTo(target.x, target.y);
            ctx!.strokeStyle = 'rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05)';
            ctx!.lineWidth = 1;
            ctx!.stroke();

            // Traveling pulse
            const pulsePos = (Math.sin(time * 2 + node.pulsePhase) + 1) / 2;
            const px = node.x + (target.x - node.x) * pulsePos;
            const py = node.y + (target.y - node.y) * pulsePos;
            const pulseGlow = ctx!.createRadialGradient(px, py, 0, px, py, 8);
            pulseGlow.addColorStop(0, 'rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12)');
            pulseGlow.addColorStop(1, 'rgba(168, 85, 247, 0)');
            ctx!.fillStyle = pulseGlow;
            ctx!.beginPath();
            ctx!.arc(px, py, 8, 0, Math.PI * 2);
            ctx!.fill();
          }
        }

        // Draw nodes
        for (const node of nodes) {
          const pulse = Math.sin(time * 2 + node.pulsePhase) * 0.3 + 0.7;
          ctx!.beginPath();
          ctx!.arc(node.x, node.y, 2.5, 0, Math.PI * 2);
          ctx!.fillStyle = `rgba(168, 85, 247, ${0.4 * pulse})`;
          ctx!.fill();
        }

        animId = requestAnimationFrame(draw);
      }
      draw();
      window.addEventListener('resize', () => { w = canvas.width = window.innerWidth; h = canvas.height = canvas.parentElement!.scrollHeight; });
      document.addEventListener('astro:before-swap', () => cancelAnimationFrame(animId));
    }
    initCircuit();
    document.addEventListener('astro:after-swap', initCircuit);
  </script>

  <style>
    .projects-container {
      min-height: 100vh;
      background: var(--background-color);
      color: var(--text-color);
      padding: 110px 24px 80px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      position: relative;
    }
    #circuit-canvas { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; pointer-events: none; }
    .projects-inner { position: relative; z-index: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; width: 100%; }
    .projects-header { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 48px; max-width: 700px; }
    .projects-tag { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.15em; color: var(--primary-color); margin-bottom: 22px; display: block; }
    .projects-header h1 { font-size: 42px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 14px; }
    .projects-header p { font-size: 17px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.6; }

    .one-card-wrapper { display: flex; justify-content: center; width: 100%; }
    .major-project-card {
      background: var(--card-bg);
      border-radius: 18px;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
      max-width: 700px;
      padding: 48px 36px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
      transition: border-color 0.4s, box-shadow 0.4s;
    }
    .major-project-card:hover { border-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12); box-shadow: 0 8px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); }
    .role-header { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .role-header h2 { font-size: 1.35rem; color: var(--primary-color); font-weight: 700; margin: 0; line-height: 1.3; }
    .role-header h3 { font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--text-color); font-weight: 700; margin: 0; line-height: 1.3; }
    .role-company { font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 4px; font-style: italic; }
    .role-dates { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-muted); font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; white-space: nowrap; padding-top: 4px; }
    .project-intro { font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
    .stage-block { margin-bottom: 28px; }
    .stage-title { margin-bottom: 8px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; }
    .stage-title span { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--primary-color); font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; }
    .stage-title hr { border: none; border-top: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); flex: 1; margin: 0; }
    .stage-block strong { display: block; margin-bottom: 7px; color: var(--text-color); font-size: 1rem; }
    .stage-block p { line-height: 1.7; color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.95rem; }
    .results-bar { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 16px; margin-top: 1.5rem; padding: 24px; background: var(--primary-subtle); border-radius: 12px; text-align: center; border: 1px solid var(--card-border); }
    .result-stat { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; }
    .stat-number { font-size: 1.6rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--primary-color); }
    .stat-label { font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--text-muted); }

    .stack-banner { max-width: 700px; width: 100%; text-align: center; margin-top: 48px; padding: 20px 24px; background: var(--card-bg); border: 1px solid var(--card-border); border-radius: 12px; }
    .stack-label { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: var(--text-muted); display: block; margin-bottom: 10px; }
    .stack-items { display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .stack-item { color: var(--text-color); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; }
    .stack-dot { width: 4px; height: 4px; background: var(--primary-color); border-radius: 50%; }

    .prior-section { max-width: 700px; width: 100%; margin-top: 48px; text-align: center; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px; align-items: center; }
    .prior-tag { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.15em; color: var(--primary-color); display: block; margin-bottom: 6px; }
    .prior-card { background: var(--card-bg); border: 1px solid var(--card-border); border-radius: 16px; padding: 32px; text-align: left; transition: border-color 0.4s, box-shadow 0.4s; width: 100%; }
    .prior-card:hover { border-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12); box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05); }
    .prior-card > p { font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 12px; }
    .prior-list { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; }
    .prior-list li { padding: 10px 0 10px 20px; position: relative; font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.65; }
    .prior-list li::before { content: ""; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 18px; width: 6px; height: 6px; background: var(--primary-color); border-radius: 50%; }

    .case-cta { margin-top: 60px; text-align: center; }
    .case-cta p { font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 20px; }
    .cta-button { display: inline-block; padding: 14px 32px; background: #191918; color: #ffffff; border-radius: 10px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; box-shadow: 0 4px 24px var(--primary-glow); transition: all 0.3s; }
    .cta-button:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 8px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12); }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .projects-header h1 { font-size: 30px; }
      .major-project-card { padding: 24px 20px; }
      .results-bar { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
    }
  </style>
</MainLayout>
